{"schemaVersion":"public-read-v0.1","items":[{"publicId":"public-rss-0048cc22ee17a8b39363ed7cc7e8cf8d58441d189611ba0e2cb13ded9174f67c","contentType":"race_news","state":"ready","titleZh":"F1意大利大奖赛：加斯利职业生涯首夺杆位，车迷欢呼“疯狂”","summaryZh":"在2026年意大利大奖赛排位赛中，Alpine车队的皮埃尔·加斯利以0.060秒的优势击败梅赛德斯车手乔治·拉塞尔，夺得个人职业生涯首个杆位。本赛季是2026年新技术规则实施的第一年，梅赛德斯车手拉塞尔和目前领跑积分榜的基米·安东内利一直主导着比赛。加斯利在蒙扎的表现打破了这一格局，引发车迷热烈庆祝。","publishedAt":"2026-09-07T07:01:47.337Z","sourcePublishedAt":"2026-09-05T17:33:58.000Z","sourceTimeStatus":"known","source":{"sourceId":"motorsport-f1-news","platform":"rss","displayName":"Motorsport.com","byline":"Motorsport.com","accessStatus":"available"},"media":{"kind":"source_image","assetRef":"https://cdn-2.motorsport.com/images/amp/YvKBPbG6/s6/pierre-gasly-alpine.jpg","mimeType":"image/jpeg","declaredBytes":234679,"altZh":"F1意大利大奖赛：加斯利职业生涯首夺杆位，车迷欢呼“疯狂”"},"originalLink":{"enabled":true,"url":"https://www.motorsport.com/f1/news/f1-fans-celebrate-pierre-gasly-after-insane-italian-gp-pole-position/10852712/?utm_source=RSS&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=RSS-F1&amp;utm_term=News&amp;utm_content=www","reason":null}},{"publicId":"public-rss-bf80880f1845849054792e0e2b7b0def073741b1bcfc860d98ba55bd98e03ed8","contentType":"race_news","state":"ready","titleZh":"维斯塔潘解释红牛赛车“纸糊”言论：神秘问题困扰排位赛","summaryZh":"马克斯·维斯塔潘在蒙扎排位赛后表示，周五练习中已感到赛车平衡“脱节”，因此预料到排位赛会很艰难。最终他仅列第六，落后爆冷夺得杆位的皮埃尔·加斯利近0.3秒。维斯塔潘还解释了此前称赛车“纸糊”的言论，暗示存在神秘问题。","publishedAt":"2026-09-07T07:03:18.662Z","sourcePublishedAt":"2026-09-05T17:26:53.000Z","sourceTimeStatus":"known","source":{"sourceId":"motorsport-f1-news","platform":"rss","displayName":"Motorsport.com","byline":"Motorsport.com","accessStatus":"available"},"media":{"kind":"source_image","assetRef":"https://cdn-4.motorsport.com/images/amp/0mXyQ3X6/s6/max-verstappen-red-bull-racing.jpg","mimeType":"image/jpeg","declaredBytes":212096,"altZh":"维斯塔潘解释红牛赛车“纸糊”言论：神秘问题困扰排位赛"},"originalLink":{"enabled":true,"url":"https://www.motorsport.com/f1/news/max-verstappen-explains-red-bull-car-made-out-of-paper-comment-after-mysterious-issue/10852691/?utm_source=RSS&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=RSS-F1&amp;utm_term=News&amp;utm_content=www","reason":null}},{"publicId":"public-rss-656f8d970f091ea5b997d108322c6f3c581bdfad6824fe89afdfaad97c8c335b","contentType":"race_news","state":"ready","titleZh":"勒克莱尔给加斯利的建议在意大利大奖赛排位赛中反噬自身","summaryZh":"在F1意大利大奖赛排位赛中，皮埃尔·加斯利爆冷夺得杆位，他的好友夏尔·勒克莱尔是第一批前往维修区祝贺他的车手之一。勒克莱尔此前曾给加斯利提出建议，但这一建议在排位赛中反而让勒克莱尔自己吃亏。","publishedAt":"2026-09-07T06:58:43.607Z","sourcePublishedAt":"2026-09-05T17:04:30.000Z","sourceTimeStatus":"known","source":{"sourceId":"motorsport-f1-news","platform":"rss","displayName":"Motorsport.com","byline":"Motorsport.com","accessStatus":"available"},"media":{"kind":"source_image","assetRef":"https://cdn-4.motorsport.com/images/amp/0R7BpKA2/s6/charles-leclerc-ferrari-pierre.jpg","mimeType":"image/jpeg","declaredBytes":290351,"altZh":"勒克莱尔给加斯利的建议在意大利大奖赛排位赛中反噬自身"},"originalLink":{"enabled":true,"url":"https://www.motorsport.com/f1/news/how-charles-leclercs-advice-to-pierre-gasly-came-back-to-bite-him-in-italian-gp-qualifying/10852677/?utm_source=RSS&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=RSS-F1&amp;utm_term=News&amp;utm_content=www","reason":null}},{"publicId":"public-rss-b36d03369e660c539873a5df5f72b9c40effe099c02cb49d416b1a1c4697a9ad","contentType":"race_news","state":"ready","titleZh":"梅赛德斯调侃托托·沃尔夫在意大利大奖赛排位赛中的愤怒时刻","summaryZh":"梅赛德斯车队在意大利大奖赛排位赛后，调侃了自家领队托托·沃尔夫。此前，沃尔夫在蒙扎Q3最后时刻，因皮埃尔·加斯利以0.060秒优势夺得杆位，击败梅赛德斯车手乔治·拉塞尔，而愤怒地击打车库计时台。梅赛德斯官方对此进行了幽默回应。","publishedAt":"2026-09-07T06:57:52.606Z","sourcePublishedAt":"2026-09-05T16:59:29.000Z","sourceTimeStatus":"known","source":{"sourceId":"motorsport-f1-news","platform":"rss","displayName":"Motorsport.com","byline":"Motorsport.com","accessStatus":"available"},"media":{"kind":"source_image","assetRef":"https://cdn-4.motorsport.com/images/amp/0JXwg5MY/s6/toto-wolff-mercedes.jpg","mimeType":"image/jpeg","declaredBytes":205838,"altZh":"梅赛德斯调侃托托·沃尔夫在意大利大奖赛排位赛中的愤怒时刻"},"origin