y-alpine-3.jpg","mimeType":"image/jpeg","declaredBytes":259656,"altZh":"2026年F1意大利大奖赛正赛发车顺位公布"},"originalLink":{"enabled":true,"url":"https://www.motorsport.com/f1/news/the-starting-grid-for-the-2026-F1-Italian-GP/10852582/?utm_source=RSS&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=RSS-F1&amp;utm_term=News&amp;utm_content=www","reason":null}},{"publicId":"public-rss-e1fa0a3c7e6919e10aa59df0e28418255179c7b58f4744eab8c89d493dd5dcd8","contentType":"race_news","state":"ready","titleZh":"F1意大利大奖赛：皮埃尔·加斯利在蒙扎夺得惊人首个杆位","summaryZh":"在首次赢得大奖赛的赛道上，Alpine车手皮埃尔·加斯利在蒙扎又书写了F1生涯的辉煌篇章，夺得个人首个杆位。在激动人心的Q3对决中，加斯利以仅0.060秒的优势击败赛前热门乔治·拉塞尔，阻止了梅赛德斯车手获得本赛季第五个杆位，并让Alpine登上成绩榜首位。拉塞尔此前曾率先取得领先。","publishedAt":"2026-09-07T06:50:28.120Z","sourcePublishedAt":"2026-09-05T15:15:33.000Z","sourceTimeStatus":"known","source":{"sourceId":"motorsport-f1-news","platform":"rss","displayName":"Motorsport.com","byline":"Motorsport.com","accessStatus":"available"},"media":{"kind":"source_image","assetRef":"https://cdn-1.motorsport.com/images/amp/0R7BpKo2/s6/pierre-gasly-alpine-4.jpg","mimeType":"image/jpeg","declaredBytes":242947,"altZh":"F1意大利大奖赛：皮埃尔·加斯利在蒙扎夺得惊人首个杆位"},"originalLink":{"enabled":true,"url":"https://www.motorsport.com/f1/news/f1-italian-gp-qualifying-report/10852577/?utm_source=RSS&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=RSS-F1&amp;utm_term=News&amp;utm_content=www","reason":null}},{"publicId":"public-rss-b52885fb857b08fb0f9e1eb96750383efa2399a38ac5b973a898509faedb52db","contentType":"race_news","state":"ready","titleZh":"F1 2026排位赛队友对决：意大利大奖赛","summaryZh":"Motorsport.com在每场F1排位赛后发布各车队队友间的排位赛对决记录。该记录仅基于排位赛成绩，因此罚退不会影响统计。若车手因技术问题或事故未能做出有效圈速，将在表格中注明。","publishedAt":"2026-09-07T06:51:28.297Z","sourcePublishedAt":"2026-09-05T15:07:41.000Z","sourceTimeStatus":"known","source":{"sourceId":"motorsport-f1-news","platform":"rss","displayName":"Motorsport.com","byline":"Motorsport.com","accessStatus":"available"},"media":{"kind":"source_image","assetRef":"https://cdn-2.motorsport.com/images/amp/YXyK1p56/s6/cha